## What Success Looks Like

Success isn't just a long list of features.

It means being able to explain the code, justify design decisions, reproduce the development environment, investigate bugs, and demonstrate working software.

By developing ClientPulse, I want to build evidence of practical Java skills and a stronger understanding of Minecraft client development. The repository will document the actual work rather than simply list technologies or ambitions.

